<!-- HU2 - Consulta de posibles empresas duplicadas (sin eliminación automática) -->
<div class="modal fade" id="dlgDuplicadosHU2" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="dlgDuplicadosHU2Titulo" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg">
            <div class="modal-header text-white">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-semibold" id="dlgDuplicadosHU2Titulo">
                        <i class="bi bi-buildings me-2"></i>Posibles empresas duplicadas
                    </h5>
                    <small class="text-muted">Coincidencias detectadas por RFC normalizado · Consulta de solo lectura</small>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Cerrar"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div id="hu2DuplicadosCargando" class="text-center py-5" role="status" aria-live="polite">
                    <div class="spinner-border text-primary mb-3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Consultando empresas en el servidor...</p>
                </div>
                <div id="hu2DuplicadosError" class="alert alert-danger d-none" role="alert"></div>
                <div id="hu2DuplicadosSinResultados" class="text-center py-5 d-none">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle text-success" style="font-size:2.5rem"></i>
                    <h6 class="mt-3">No se encontraron RFC duplicados</h6>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">La revisión actual no detectó grupos de empresas con el mismo RFC normalizado.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="hu2DuplicadosResultados" class="d-none">
                    <div class="alert alert-info d-flex align-items-start gap-2" role="note">
                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill mt-1"></i>
                        <div>Estos registros son <strong>posibles duplicados</strong>, no eliminaciones confirmadas. Revisa la documentación y las relaciones antes de decidir cómo depurarlos.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-3">
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-primary" id="hu2DuplicadosTotalGrupos">0 grupos</span>
                        <span class="text-muted small" id="hu2DuplicadosTotalEmpresas">0 registros relacionados</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="table-responsive border rounded-3">
                        <table class="table table-hover table-striped align-middle mb-0">
                            <thead class="table-light">
                                <tr><th scope="col">RFC</th><th scope="col">Empresas coincidentes</th><th scope="col" class="text-center">Cantidad</th></tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="hu2DuplicadosFilas"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" onclick="consultarDuplicadosHU2()">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i>Actualizar
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cerrar</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Sección Nuevo/Editar/Ver Registro --- -->
<!-- <div id="dlgEmpresa" class="modal fade" data-bs-backdrop="static" data-bs-keyboard="false" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"> -->
<div id="dlgEmpresa" class="modal fade" data-bs-backdrop="static" data-bs-keyboard="false" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
	<div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl">
		<div class="modal-content">
			<div class="modal-header">
				<h5 id="dlgEmpresaTitle" class="modal-title"></h5>
				<button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-body align-items-center">
				<form id="theForm"
					  method="post"
					  data-autosave-draft="true"
					  data-draft-key="Empresa">
					<div class="container-fluid">
						<div class="row">
							<div class="col-3 col-lg-2">
								<div class="form-floating mb-3">
									<input id="inpEmpresaId" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Id" type="text" class="form-control" />
									<label for="inpEmpresaId" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Id" class="form-label"></label>
									<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.Id" class="text-danger"></span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="saveValidationSummary" class="text-danger mb-3" role="alert"></div>
						@if (tieneAccesoEmpresas)
						{
							<div class="accordion shadow-sm mb-5" id="accordionOne">
								<div class="accordion-item">
									<h2 class="accordion-header" id="primerSeccion">
										<button class="accordion-button p-2 bg-gradient bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-black" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSectionOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseSectionOne">
											<h5>@Localizer["EmpresaPrimerSeccionTitle"]</h5>
										</button>
									</h2>
									<div id="collapseSectionOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="primerSeccion" data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
										<div class="accordion-body">
											<div class="row">
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<input id="inpEmpresaRazonSocial" asp-for="InputEmpresa.RazonSocial" type="text" class="form-control formInput" placeholder="@Localizer["RazonSocialPlaceholder"]" />
														<label for="inpEmpresaRazonSocial" asp-for="InputEmpresa.RazonSocial" class="form-label required"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.RazonSocial" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<select id="selEmpresaPerfil" asp-for="InputEmpresa.PerfilId" class="form-select formSelect" placeholder="@Localizer["PerfilPlaceholder"]">
															@{
																foreach (Perfil perfil in perfiles)
																{
																	<option value='@perfil.Id'>@perfil.Nombre</option>
																}
															}
														</select>
														<label for="selEmpresaPerfil" asp-for="InputEmpresa.PerfilId" class="form-label required"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.PerfilId" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<input id="inpEmpresaAdministrador" type="text" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Administrador" class="form-control formInput" placeholder="@Localizer["AdministradorPlaceholder"]" />
														<label for="inpEmpresaAdministrador" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Administrador" class="form-label"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.Administrador" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<input id="inpEmpresaAccionista" type="text" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Accionista" class="form-control formInput" placeholder="@Localizer["AccionistaPlaceholder"]" />
														<label for="inpEmpresaAccionista" asp-for="InputEmpresa.Accionista" class="form-label"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.Accionista" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
											</div>
											<div class="row">
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<input id="inpEmpresaRFC" asp-for="InputEmpresa.RFC" type="text" class="form-control formInput" placeholder="@Localizer["RFCPlaceholder"]" />
														<label for="inpEmpresaRFC" asp-for="InputEmpresa.RFC" class="form-label"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.RFC" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<select id="selEmpresaOrigen" asp-for="InputEmpresa.OrigenId" class="form-select formSelect" placeholder="@Localizer["OrigenPlaceholder"]">
															@{
																foreach (Origen origen in origenes)
																{
																	<option value='@origen.Id'>@origen.Nombre</option>
																}
															}
														</select>
														<label for="selEmpresaOrigen" asp-for="InputEmpresa.OrigenId" class="form-label"></label>
														<span asp-validation-for="InputEmpresa.OrigenId" class="text-danger"></span>
													</div>
												</div>
												<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
													<div class="form-floating mb-3">
														<select id="selEmpresaNivel" asp-for="InputEmpresa.NivelId" class="form-select formSelect" placeholder="@Localizer["NivelPlaceholder"]">
															@{
																foreach (Nivel nivel in niveles)
																{
																	<option value='@nivel.Id'>@nivel.Nombre</option>
																}
															}
														</select>
														<label for="selEmpresaNivel" asp-for="InputEmpresa.NivelId" class="form-label required"></label>
